{"id":"bba47d15e357cf58","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-pi11random.md","title":"Pi11 随机性","display":"df-pi11random — Pi11 随机性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-pi11random","aliases":["43-df-pi11random"],"display":"df-pi11random — Pi11 随机性","depends_on":["[[43-df-cylinder]]","[[43-df-pi11]]","[[43-df-measure]]"],"source_edition":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖","source_local_support":"Outer measure construction: supplied book §4.2, printed p.3 / PDF p.23; local Borel-cover equivalent form","source_locator":"External: Chong–Nies–Yu, Def.3.1(1), PDF p.4; https://www.cs.auckland.ac.nz/~nies/papers_till_09/ChongNiesYu_LownessHigherRandomness.pdf","verification_status":"external-definition-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-pi11random"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-pi11random</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pi11random — Pi11 随机性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"689c9916fcffb575\" href=\"?note=689c9916fcffb575\" title=\"43-df-pi11\">43-df-pi11</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8e999d59227f4a28\" href=\"?note=8e999d59227f4a28\" title=\"43-df-measure\">43-df-measure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖"},{"key":"source_local_support","html":"Outer measure construction: supplied book §4.2, printed p.3 / PDF p.23; local Borel-cover equivalent form"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"External: Chong–Nies–Yu, Def.3.1(1), PDF p.4; <a href=\"https://www.cs.auckland.ac.nz/~nies/papers_till_09/ChongNiesYu_LownessHigherRandomness.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.cs.auckland.ac.nz/~nies/papers_till_09/ChongNiesYu_LownessHigherRandomness.pdf</a>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"external-definition-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_1(2^\\omega)\">\\(\\Pi^1_1(2^\\omega)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"689c9916fcffb575\" href=\"?note=689c9916fcffb575\" title=\"43-df-pi11\">43-df-pi11</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\)</span> 上的公平硬币 Borel 概率测度。本页为任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(E\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span> 内建外测度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu^*\">\\(\\mu^*\\)</span>，不假定上游已定义完备化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu^*(E):=\\inf\\{\\mu(B):B\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\land E\\subseteq B\\}.\\qquad\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{Random}(X)\\iff\\forall G\\in\\Pi^1_1(2^\\omega)\\,[\\mu^*(G)=0\\Rightarrow X\\notin G].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu^*(E):=\\inf\\{\\mu(B):B\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\land E\\subseteq B\\}.\\qquad\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{Random}(X)\\iff\\forall G\\in\\Pi^1_1(2^\\omega)\\,[\\mu^*(G)=0\\Rightarrow X\\notin G].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>重大纠错：原文量化 Σ11 零类，却命名 Π11 随机。现改为真正 Π11 零类，并固定 lightface；不能允许任意实参数。外测度的候选集合含整个空间，故下确界总有定义；解析与余解析类 Lebesgue 可测，因此此零外测度条件与一手文献的零测度条件相同，同时避免对仅在 Borel 域上定义的 μ 作越域调用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pi11","status":"resolved","id":"689c9916fcffb575","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pi11]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"8e999d59227f4a28","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pi11","status":"resolved","id":"689c9916fcffb575","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\Pi^1_1(2^\\omega)$ 见 [[43-df-pi11]]，$\\mu$ 是 [[43-df-cylinder]] 在 $\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 上的公平硬币 Borel 概率测度。本页为任意 $E\\subseteq2^\\omega$ 内建外测度 $\\mu^*$，不假定上游已定义完备化。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\Pi^1_1(2^\\omega)$ 见 [[43-df-pi11]]，$\\mu$ 是 [[43-df-cylinder]] 在 $\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 上的公平硬币 Borel 概率测度。本页为任意 $E\\subseteq2^\\omega$ 内建外测度 $\\mu^*$，不假定上游已定义完备化。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^1_1(2^\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu^*","display":false}